Build-Depends: debhelper (>= 10), make
Standards-Version: 4.4.0.1
Homepage: https://www.buskill.in

Package: buskill-vm
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, udev
Description: BusKill laptop kill cord for QubesOS (VM package)
 BusKill is a laptop kill cord. When the USB cable's magnetic breakaway is
 severed, it triggers your computer to lock, shutdown, or shred its LUKS
 encryption keys -- keeping your encrypted data safe from thieves.
 .
 This package installs the udev rules and scripts for the sys-usb VM in
 QubesOS. Install this package in the TemplateVM used by your sys-usb qube.
 .
 After installing this package, you must also install the buskill-dom0 package
 in dom0 to configure the qrexec services.
